<title>UK: Dresdner Finance adds 500 mln Ffr to 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Finance adds 500 mln Ffr to 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Dresdner Klienwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *2.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    05.NOV.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.908   PAY DATE  **14.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    101.258   SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 2.0 BILLION FFR ON 08.OCT.96</p>
<p>	    **PLUS 69 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 S&amp;P	  AA+	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR/NL/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.35 PCT  SELL CONC   1.65 PCT</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OAT DUE OCT.2008.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
